# No runtime data files ship in the wheel. The code in
# google_oauth_verification_preflight/ reads only the JSON file you pass it, and
# no CLI flag prints or copies templates/*.md - those are documents a human reads,
# copies and edits. They still belong in the sdist, which is the full source
# distribution, so they are listed here as documentation.
include README.md
include LICENSE
include COMMON-REJECTIONS.md
include PRE-SUBMISSION-CHECKLIST.md
include templates/*.md
include check_consent.py
include examples/*.json
